core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T15:39:15-08:00","id":832796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malcolm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/830298-interview-with-new-white-wolf?p=832709#post832709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> It's funny when people are so desperate to prove their political purity they just say shit that sounds the part without necessarily thinking or knowing what they're talking about. In the case of Charnel Houses of Europe: The Shoah we're talking about a book written by a Jewish man in consultation with actual survivors of Nazi violence, one of whom wrote an introduction to the book. I somehow doubt you knew either of these things, and simply picked what you thought was an easy target.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I couldn't agree more, and I'm Jewish and lost much of my family in the Holocaust. In fact, I still recall how pleasantly surprised I was with the book's quality and sensitivity when I first read it nearly 20 years ago.<br /> <br /> However, I do believe that WOD: Gypsies was, to put it kindly, &quot;unfortunate,&quot; similarly believe a WOD book incorporating 9/11 within its supernatural cosmology so soon after it occurred would have had the potential to be quite raw and offensive, as well as an unnecessary commercial risk, at least in the USA, and I otherwise do not necessarily agree with much of Martin's vision concerning the new One World of Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T16:23:00-08:00","id":832818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/830298-interview-with-new-white-wolf?p=832791#post832791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> On zip lines</div> </div> </div> </div>With blackjack. And hookers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":375,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","user":"Papa Bear","date":". 02-18-2016, 07:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T22:57:30-08:00","id":833057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_c