ting crap from cover to cover. It would have been the worst book WW ever put out, if not for <i>Gypsies</i> (And even then it's close).</div> </div> </div> </div>I would legitimately like to know what part of Shoah you found so objectionable. Was it the subject matter in and of itself, or how it was handled?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T00:55:10-08:00","id":833101,"title":"","content":"I don't think <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2082-schleiermacher\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2082\" data-vbnamecard=\"2082\">Schleiermacher</a> is coming back guys","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T01:07:21-08:00","id":833103,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:blue\">News just in! Apparently they've decided to go back to earlier editions, and so are replacing the metaplot with Haight in a trenchcoat dual-weilding katana.</span><br /> <br /> In regards to Shoah, it's a book I really wish I owned, because I've heard it's horrible. Not horrible in a 'badly written' sense, not in a 'badly researched' sense, not in a 'disrespectful' sense, but horrible in a 'these horrific acts happened, and I'm not going to lie' sense. It's proof that the worst of what humans do can be included in a game with no sugar coating. It is not proof that you can include horrible recent events well (which you can do, but the best I've seen was the entire supernatural community in Unknown Armies looking at 9/11 and going 'well, fuck').","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T01:13:59-08:00","id":833105,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4507\" data-vbnamecard=\"4507\">TwoDSix</a> is there supposed to be a link in that blue text?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T02:01:18-08:00","id":833121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_containe